· 8 rows (see DATA) • Range tabs: 1D · 5D · 1M · 6M · YTD · 1Y · 5Y · MAX · current: 1D • Stock: Logo_GOTO · GOTO · GoTo Gojek Tokopedia · Rp189 · falling −Rp9 (−4,55%) · “Hari ini”\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: Beli · Jual\\n• Chart: 1D price line with a highlighted point and tooltip, time axis 6:00 – 2:00 (see DATA)\\n• Compare: “Dibandingkan dengan” · BUKA · BBRI · SIDO, each with company, ticker, price and change (see DATA)\\n• Header: back (Icon_Back) · add (Icon_Plus) · share (Icon_Share) · favorite (Icon_Star)\\n• Key stats: “Keystats” · 8 rows (see DATA)\\n• Range tabs: 1D · 5D · 1M · 6M · YTD · 1Y · 5Y · MAX · current: 1D\\n• Stock: Logo_GOTO · GOTO · GoTo Gojek Tokopedia · Rp189 · falling −Rp9 (−4,55%) · “Hari ini”\",\"id\":\"4:32\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\",\"id\":\"4:33\"},{\"name\":\"→ back → 02_Trending\",\"characters\":\"→ back → 02_Trending\",\"id\":\"4:34\"},{\"name\":\"04_Top_Up_Metode\",\"characters\":\"04_Top_Up_Metode\",\"id\":\"4:36\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Choose how to top up my balance.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Choose how to top up my balance.\",\"id\":\"4:37\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"id\":\"4:38\"},{\"name\":\"• Balance: “Dana Saya” · Rp2.125.000 • Header: “Top Up” · back (Icon_Back) · help (Icon_Help) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Top Up • Methods: “Pilih Metode” · ATM (Icon_ATM) · Kartu Debit (Icon_Debit_Card) · Mobile Banking (Icon_Mobile_Banking) · Indomaret (Icon_Store) · Alfamart (Icon_Store), each opens its next step (Icon_Chevron_Right)\",\"characters\":\"• Balance: “Dana Saya” · Rp2.125.000\\n• Header: “Top Up” · back (Icon_Back) · help (Icon_Help)\\n• Main navigation: tab bar · current: Top Up\\n• Methods: “Pilih Metode” · ATM (Icon_ATM) · Kartu Debit (Icon_Debit_Card) · Mobile Banking (Icon_Mobile_Banking) · Indomaret (Icon_Store) · Alfamart (Icon_Store), each opens its next step (Icon_Chevron_Right)\",\"id\":\"4:39\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\",\"id\