d\":\"4:52\"},{\"name\":\"• Action: Oke • Deadline: “Bayar Sebelum” · Minggu, 30 Oktober 2022, 13:32 WIB · countdown 00 : 08 : 46 • Guide: “Panduan Pembayaran” · 6 steps (see DATA) • Payment: No Transaksi · Nominal · Kode Pembayaran with copy (Icon_Copy) (see DATA) • Title: “Selesaikan Pembayaran” · “Silakan selesaikan proses pembayaran”\",\"characters\":\"• Action: Oke\\n• Deadline: “Bayar Sebelum” · Minggu, 30 Oktober 2022, 13:32 WIB · countdown 00 : 08 : 46\\n• Guide: “Panduan Pembayaran” · 6 steps (see DATA)\\n• Payment: No Transaksi · Nominal · Kode Pembayaran with copy (Icon_Copy) (see DATA)\\n• Title: “Selesaikan Pembayaran” · “Silakan selesaikan proses pembayaran”\",\"id\":\"4:53\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\",\"id\":\"4:54\"},{\"name\":\"→ Oke → 01_Aktivitas\",\"characters\":\"→ Oke → 01_Aktivitas\",\"id\":\"4:55\"},{\"name\":\"Navigation structure\",\"characters\":\"Navigation structure\",\"id\":\"4:57\"},{\"name\":\"• Bottom tab bar with 5 tabs in this order: Aktivitas (Icon_Tab_Aktivitas), Trending (Icon_Tab_Trending), Top Up (Icon_Plus), Pasar (Icon_Tab_Pasar), Profil (Icon_Tab_Profil). Current tab: Aktivitas on 01, Trending on 02, Top Up on 04 and 05. 03 and 06 have no tab bar. How the current tab looks is yours. • Browse flow: 01_Aktivitas → 02_Trending → 03_Detail_Saham (GOTO). • Top-up flow: 01_Aktivitas (Deposit or Top Up tab) → 04_Top_Up_Metode → 05_Top_Up_Nominal (Alfamart) → 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran → Oke → 01_Aktivitas. • Entry only (no frame): menu, settings, Tarik, watchlist add, other tickers, Crypto / Reksadana / CFD, Eropa / Amerika / Mata Uang, 24 jam, Lihat Semua, Rekomendasi cards, range tabs other than 1D, add / share / favorite, Jual, Beli, compare items, ATM / Kartu Debit / Mobile Banking / Indomaret, help, copy code, Pasar, Profil.\",\"characters\":\"• Bottom tab bar with 5 tabs in this order: Aktivitas (Icon_Tab_Aktivitas), Trending (Icon_Tab_Trending), Top Up (Icon_Plus), Pasar (Icon_Tab_Pasar), Profil (Icon_Tab_Profil). Current tab: Aktivitas on 01, Trending on 02, Top Up on 04 and 05. 03 and 06 have no tab bar. How the current tab looks is yours.\\n• Browse flow: 01_Aktivitas → 02_Trending → 03_Detail_Saham (GOTO).\\n• Top-up flow: 01_Aktivitas (Deposit or Top Up tab) → 04_Top_Up_Metode → 05_Top_Up_Nominal (Alfamart) → 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran → Oke → 01_Aktivitas.\\n• Entry only (no frame): menu, settings, Tarik, watchlist add, other tickers, Crypto / Reksadana / CFD, Eropa / Amerika / Mata Uang, 24 jam, Lihat Semua, Rekomendasi cards, range tabs other than 1D, add / share / favorite, Jual, Beli, compare items, ATM / Kartu Debit / Mobile Banking / Indomaret, help, copy code, Pasar, Profil.\",\"id\":\"4:58\"},{\"name\":\"Fixed data & copy\",\"characters\":\"Fixed data & copy\",\"id\":\"4:60\"},{\"name\":\"Use these values verbatim. Bahasa Indonesia; prices in rupiah; Indonesian number format (“.” thousands, “,” decimals).\",\"characters\":\"Use these values verbatim. Bahasa Indonesia; prices in rupiah; Indonesian number format (“.” thousands, “,” decimals).\",\"id\":\"4:61\"},{\"name\":\"Balance\",\"characters\":\"Balance\",\"id\":\"4:64\"},{\"name\":\"Dana Utama: Rp2.125.000 · ▲ Rp206.920 (10,79%) Dana Saya (top up): Rp2.125.000\",\"characters\":\"Dana Utama: Rp2.125.000 · ▲ Rp206.920 (10,79%)\\nDana Saya (top up): Rp2.125.000\",\"id\":\"4:65\"},{\"name\":\"Trending Hari ini (price · change)\",\"characters\":\"Trending Hari ini (price · change)\",\"id\":\"4:67\"}],\"components\":[]},\"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\":{\"id\":\"1:2\",\"textCount\":10,\"texts\":[{\"name\":\"Foundations · Stock Trading\",\"characters\":\"Foundations · Stock Trading\",\"id\":\"1:6\"},{\"name\":\"Fixed: the brand primary color, the typeface and dark mode — they carry the app’s identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: dark background and surface levels, neutrals and grays, text colors, semantic colors (gain / loss, selected, success, warning, error, disabled), chart colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\"characters\":\"Fixed: the brand primary color, the typeface and dark mode — they carry the app’s identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: dark background and surface levels, neutrals and grays, text colors, semantic colors (gain / loss, selected, success, warning, error, disabled), chart colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\"id\":\"1:7\"},{\"name\":\"Brand color\",\"characters\":\"Brand color\",\"id\":\"1:8\"},{\"name\":\"Brand primary · green\",\"characters\":\"Brand primary · green\",\"id\":\"1:11\"},{\"name\":\"#279646\",\"characters\":\"#279646\",\"id\":\"1:12\"},{\"name\":\"The app’s brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\"characters\":\"The app’s brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\"id\":\"1:13\"},{\"name\":\"Typeface\",\"characters\":\"Typeface\",\"id\":\"1:14\"},{\"name\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789 Rp2.125.000 +0,58%\",\"characters\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789  Rp2.125.000  +0,58%\",\"id\":\"1:15\"},{\"name\":\"Use Roboto for all UI text (Regular / Medium / SemiBold / Bold available). Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\",\"characters\":\"Use Roboto for all UI text (Regular / Medium / SemiBold / Bold available). Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\",\"id\":\"1:16\"},{\"name\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (Android / iPhone size). Dark mode only. Language: Bahasa Indonesia (copy is fixed in the brief). Number format: Indonesian — “.” for thousands, “,” for decimals (Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%). 01_Aktivitas, 02_Trending, 03_Detail_Saham and 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran may scroll vertically.\",\"characters\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (Android / iPhone size). Dark mode only. Language: Bahasa Indonesia (copy is fixed in the brief). Number format: Indonesian — “.” for thousands, “,” for decimals (Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%). 01_Aktivitas, 02_Trending, 03_Detail_Saham and 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran may scroll vertically.\",\"id\":\"1:17\"}],\"components\":[]},\"02 · Components 组件库\":{\"id\":\"1:3\",\"textCount\":9,\"texts\":[{\"name\":\"Components · Stock Trading (default states only)\",\"characters\":\"Components · Stock Trading (default states only)\",\"id\":\"1:19\"},{\"name\":\"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, focused, filled, disabled, selected…), the headers, the tab bar, segmented tabs and chips, and every business component (balance card, ticker cards, stock rows, index cards, chart, key-stats table, payment-method rows, amount options, stepper, payment details…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\",\"characters\":\"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, focused, filled, disabled, selected…), the headers, the tab bar, segmented tabs and chips, and every business component (balance card, ticker cards, stock rows, index cards, chart, key-stats table, payment-method rows, amount options, stepper, payment details…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\",\"id\":\"1:20\"},{\"name\":\"Button · default\",\"characters\":\"Button · default\",\"id\":\"1:21\"},{\"name\":\"Bayar\",\"characters\":\"Bayar\",\"id\":\"1:23\"},{\"name\":\"Text Field · default\",\"characters\":\"Text Field · default\",\"id\":\"1:24\"},{\"name\":\"Minimal Rp10.000\",\"characters\":\"Minimal Rp10.000\",\"id\":\"1:26\"},{\"name\":\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\",\"characters\":\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\",\"id\":\"1:27\"},{\"name\":\"Status bar and home indicator, 375 wide, transparent background with light glyphs for dark mode. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design.\",\"characters\":\"Status bar and home indicator, 375 wide, transparent background with light glyphs for dark mode. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design.\",\"id\":\"1:28\"},{\"name\":\"9:41\",\"characters\":\"9:41\",\"id\":\"1:31\"}],\"components\":[{\"name\":\"Button\",\"type\":\"COMPONENT\",\"id\":\"1:22\"},{\"name\":\"Text Field\",\"type\":\"COMPONENT\",\"id\":\"1:25\"},{\"name\":\"Status Bar\",\"type\":\"COMPONENT\",\"id\":\"1:30\"},{\"name\":\"Home Indicator\",\"type\":\"COMPONENT\",\"id\":\"1:40\"}]},\"04 · Media 素材库\":{\"id\":\"1:4\",\"textCount\":41,\"texts\":[{\"name\":\"Media · Stock Trading\",\"characters\":\"Media · Stock Trading\",\"id\":\"3:50\"},{\"name\":\"Copy these components into your own file and use them as instances. Company logos are images (crop or mask them as your layout needs, e.g. into a circle). The ticker marks of the fictional watchlist companies are vectors. Icons are light (#F2F2F2) for dark mode and carry no meaning by color — recolor them to fit your color system.\",\"characters\":\"Copy these components into your own file and use them as instances. Company logos are images (crop or mask them as your layout needs, e.g. into a circle). The ticker marks of the fictional watchlist companies are vectors. Icons are light (#F2F2F2) for dark mode and carry no meaning by color — recolor them to fit your color system.\",\"id\":\"3:51\"},{\"name\":\"Company logos (images)\",\"characters\":\"Company logos (images)\",\"id\":\"3:52\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_ABNB\",\"characters\":\"Logo_ABNB\",\"id\":\"3:55\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_ADRO\",\"characters\":\"Logo_ADRO\",\"id\":\"3:57\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_BBRI\",\"characters\":\"Logo_BBRI\",\"id\":\"3:59\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_GOTO\",\"characters\":\"Logo_GOTO\",\"id\":\"3:61\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_UNVR\",\"characters\":\"Logo_UNVR\",\"id\":\"3:63\"},{\"name\":\"Ticker marks (vectors)\",\"characters\":\"Ticker marks (vectors)\",\"id\":\"3:64\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_AMRI\",\"characters\":\"Logo_AMRI\",\"id\":\"3:67\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_ARB\",\"characters\":\"Logo_ARB\",\"id\":\"3:69\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_BRRI\",