{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610311948048187571338268d9d6YrjP7OGB","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_617b8058356249578b7f8b0ad2035f49","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.includes(\"00\"));\n  if (!page) return \"Page 00 not found\";\n  await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n  const textNodes = page.findAll(n => n.type === 'TEXT');\n  return textNodes.map(t => ({\n    name: t.name,\n    characters: t.characters,\n    id: t.id\n  }));\n})()","description":"Read all text nodes in page 00 to get full details of design task, fixed data and prototype connections","fileKey":"JFBzRSGrqYhoiYPN8CHLgF"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":18643,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29675d63-ebdc-41c5-b9bc-94637defa1d1","uuid":"14b3c2a5-c402-43f0-a4ee-b21d3f981b10","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:48:10.820Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_617b8058356249578b7f8b0ad2035f49","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_617b8058356249578b7f8b0ad2035f49","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[{\"name\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"characters\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"id\":\"4:4\"},{\"name\":\"Stock Trading — Indonesian stock investing app\",\"characters\":\"Stock Trading — Indonesian stock investing app\",\"id\":\"4:5\"},{\"name\":\"Design an Indonesian stock investing app (Bahasa Indonesia, dark mode): see your main balance, today’s trending tickers and your watchlist, browse global trending stocks, open the GOTO stock detail, and top up your balance at Alfamart up to the payment code. Canvas 375 × 812, dark mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"characters\":\"Design an Indonesian stock investing app (Bahasa Indonesia, dark mode): see your main balance, today’s trending tickers and your watchlist, browse global trending stocks, open the GOTO stock detail, and top up your balance at Alfamart up to the payment code. Canvas 375 × 812, dark mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"id\":\"4:6\"},{\"name\":\"How to work\",\"characters\":\"How to work\",\"id\":\"4:8\"},{\"name\":\"1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color, the typeface and dark mode in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (dark background and surface levels, neutrals, text, gain / loss, selected, warning, error / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, tabs and chips, and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the company logos, ticker marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly (Indonesian number format: Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%). This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"characters\":\"1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The brand primary color, the typeface and dark mode in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (dark background and surface levels, neutrals, text, gain / loss, selected, warning, error / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, tabs and chips, and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the company logos, ticker marks and icons from 04 · Media.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly (Indonesian number format: Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%). This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"id\":\"4:9\"},{\"name\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"characters\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"id\":\"4:11\"},{\"name\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"characters\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"id\":\"4:12\"},{\"name\":\"01_Aktivitas\",\"characters\":\"01_Aktivitas\",\"id\":\"4:15\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: See my balance, today’s trending tickers and my watchlist.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: See my balance, today’s trending tickers and my watchlist.\",\"id\":\"4:16\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"id\":\"4:17\"},{\"name\":\"• Actions: Deposit (Icon_Deposit) · Tarik (Icon_Withdraw) • Balance: “Dana Utama” · Rp2.125.000 · rising Rp206.920 (10,79%) • Header: “Aktivitas” · menu (Icon_Menu) · settings (Icon_Settings) • Main navigation: tab bar Aktivitas / Trending / Top Up / Pasar / Profil · current: Aktivitas • Trending today: “Trending Hari ini” · BRRI · ARB · FSX, each with mark, ticker, price and change (see DATA) • Watchlist: “Watchlist Saya” · add (Icon_Plus) · DHDI · AMRI · ODD · PYQ · DAN, each with mark, ticker, company, price and change (see DATA)\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: Deposit (Icon_Deposit) · Tarik (Icon_Withdraw)\\n• Balance: “Dana Utama” · Rp2.125.000 · rising Rp206.920 (10,79%)\\n• Header: “Aktivitas” · menu (Icon_Menu) · settings (Icon_Settings)\\n• Main navigation: tab bar Aktivitas / Trending / Top Up / Pasar / Profil · current: Aktivitas\\n• Trending today: “Trending Hari ini” · BRRI · ARB · FSX, each with mark, ticker, price and change (see DATA)\\n• Watchlist: “Watchlist Saya” · add (Icon_Plus) · DHDI · AMRI · ODD · PYQ · DAN, each with mark, ticker, company, price and change (see DATA)\",\"id\":\"4:18\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\",\"id\":\"4:19\"},{\"name\":\"→ Deposit → 04_Top_Up_Metode → Trending tab → 02_Trending → Top Up tab → 04_Top_Up_Metode\",\"characters\":\"→ Deposit → 04_Top_Up_Metode\\n→ Trending tab → 02_Trending\\n→ Top Up tab → 04_Top_Up_Metode\",\"id\":\"4:20\"},{\"name\":\"02_Trending\",\"characters\":\"02_Trending\",\"id\":\"4:22\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: B